flowchart TD
    accTitle: Super Ultra Code Plan execution lifecycle
    accDescr: A request is classified as Spike, Bounded, or Architectural. All paths converge on brainstorming and a visual implementation plan gated by human approval, then route to TDD, systematic debugging, or subagent orchestration with chunk-fan-out-gather-audit loop, pass a verification gate and git hygiene, and close with a session-close debt sweep. A deep research path can inject evidence at any design phase. Compaction preserves state across context resets.

    Start(["🎯 User Request / Intent"]) --> Classify{"1️⃣ Task\nClassification"}

    Classify -->|Spike| PathSpike["🔬 Exploratory Spike\n& Hypothesis Testing"]
    Classify -->|Bounded < 2 files| PathBounded["⚡ Bounded Direct Fix"]
    Classify -->|Architectural| PathArch["🏗️ Architectural\nDesign & Brainstorming"]

    PathSpike --> DesignReport["📋 Spike Report\n& Recommendations"]
    PathArch --> Brainstorm["🧠 2️⃣ Brainstorming\nAlternatives · Trade-offs · Spec lock"]
    PathBounded --> WritePlan

    DesignReport --> Brainstorm
    Brainstorm --> Gate1{{"⏸️ Gate 1\nHuman Approval"}}
    Gate1 -->|Revisions| Brainstorm
    Gate1 -->|Approved| ResearchDecision{"Deep Research\nneeded?"}

    ResearchDecision -->|"External info required"| GraphPreflight["🕸️ Graphify Codebase\nPreflight (optional)"]
    GraphPreflight --> DeepResearch["🔭 Deep Research\nSearch → Fetch → Synthesize\n(TinyFish / web)"]
    DeepResearch --> WritePlan
    ResearchDecision -->|"Codebase sufficient"| WritePlan

    WritePlan["🗺️ 3️⃣ Visual Implementation Plan\nMermaid diagram · Todo checklist · skip_if"] --> HardGate{{"🛑 Gate 2\nHARD HUMAN APPROVAL GATE"}}

    HardGate -->|Revisions Requested| WritePlan
    HardGate -->|Approved| ExecRoute{"Execution\nStrategy"}

    ExecRoute -->|New Feature / Refactor| TDD["4️⃣ Test-Driven Development\nRED → GREEN → REFACTOR\nFailing test first"]
    ExecRoute -->|Bug Isolation| Debug["🐞 4.1 Systematic Debugging\nHypothesis → Probe → Observation\n4-Phase RCA Loop"]
    ExecRoute -->|Parallel Workstreams| ChunkPlan["📦 Chunk into smallest\nindependently verifiable units"]

    ChunkPlan --> FanOut["🚀 Fan-out: 10+ narrow\nsubagents dispatched"]
    FanOut --> SubWork["🤖 Subagents execute\nin isolated workspaces"]
    SubWork --> Gather["🔗 Gather & synthesize\nreports · dedup · re-verify"]
    Gather --> AuditChunk{"Chunk\naudit OK?"}
    AuditChunk -->|"❌ Red chunk"| ReChunk["Re-chunk &\nre-dispatch alone"]
    ReChunk --> SubWork
    AuditChunk -->|"✅ All green"| VerifyGate

    TDD --> VerifyGate
    Debug --> VerifyGate

    VerifyGate["5️⃣ Verification Before Completion\nFresh log · exit 0 · test pass · VCS diff"] --> Gate3{{"⏸️ Gate 3\nEvidence confirmed?"}}
    Gate3 -->|Evidence insufficient| TDD
    Gate3 -->|Evidence confirmed| GitHygiene

    GitHygiene["🧹 Finishing & Git Hygiene\nCommit · PR · no co-author trailers"] --> DebtSweep["6️⃣ Session-Close Debt Sweep\n3–5 ranked follow-ups harvested"]
    DebtSweep --> AskGate{{"🙋 Multi-Select\nFollow-Up Question"}}
    AskGate -->|"Items selected"| SweepFix["Execute as real work:\nchunk · subagents · TDD · verify · commit"]
    AskGate -->|"Nothing selected"| Done
    SweepFix --> Done(["✅ Zero-Debt Session\nor Documented Deferral"])

    Compact["♻️ Compaction / Context Reset\nPersist: state · decisions · evidence\nResume from last verified checkpoint"] -.->|"Continuity"| WritePlan
